# GRCh38 training and evaluation datasets

This directory contains two related dataset organizations produced from one
deterministic, chromosome-proportional selection of 202,493 records per class:

1. a fixed train/validation/test benchmark for the main learning curves; and
2. chromosome-based outer datasets for separate sensitivity and
   cross-validation experiments.

All positive and negative BED/FASTA pairs remain synchronized by record position.
The selection seed is 42.

## Fixed learning-curve benchmark

The chromosome quotas are calculated across chr1-chr22 and chrX before routing
records into fixed splits.

| split | chromosome membership | positive records | negative records | purpose |
|:------|:----------------------|-----------------:|-----------------:|:--------|
| Training 100% | Selected chromosomes except chr1 and chr2 | 167,410 | 167,410 | Learning-curve model fitting |
| Validation | chr1 selected quota | 18,069 | 18,069 | Early stopping and hyperparameter/model selection |
| Test | chr2 selected quota | 17,014 | 17,014 | Final evaluation only |
| **Complete benchmark** | chr1-chr22 and chrX | **202,493** | **202,493** | — |

The fixed files are:

```text
train_100_pos.bed
train_100_pos.fa
train_100_neg.bed
train_100_neg.fa
validation_pos.bed
validation_pos.fa
validation_neg.bed
validation_neg.fa
test_pos.bed
test_pos.fa
test_neg.bed
test_neg.fa
train_100_manifest.tsv
train_100_summary.json
```

Validation and test are each written once and are not percentage-subsetted. The
test set must not be used for tuning, early stopping, checkpoint selection, or
threshold selection.

The nested training subsets in `../learning_curves/` are prefixes of one fixed
shuffle of the 167,410-record-per-class training pool:

| training percentage | records per class |
|--------------------:|------------------:|
| 10%  | 16,741 |
| 20%  | 33,482 |
| 40%  | 66,964 |
| 60%  | 100,446 |
| 80%  | 133,928 |
| 100% | 167,410 |

## Chromosome-based outer datasets

The outer organization remains separate from the fixed learning-curve split.
Counts are per class. The held-out outer fold is available through the
corresponding directory under `../folds/`.

| outer set | training folds | held-out fold | validation chromosome | training records per class | validation records per class |
|:----------|:---------------|:-------------:|:----------------------|---------------------------:|-----------------------------:|
| Outer 1 | 2 + 3 + 4 | 1 | chr6 | 109,992 | 11,940 |
| Outer 2 | 1 + 3 + 4 | 2 | chr6 | 109,571 | 11,940 |
| Outer 3 | 1 + 2 + 4 | 3 | chr6 | 109,569 | 11,940 |
| Outer 4 | 1 + 2 + 3 | 4 | chr3 | 108,457 | 13,398 |

Each `outerN/` directory contains separate `train_{pos,neg}.{bed,fa}` and
`validation_{pos,neg}.{bed,fa}` files. The fixed chr1/chr2 learning-curve
routing does not replace or alter these outer-specific validation rules.
